[3773.771, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m cp /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-elec402-p2-open/6503db16-82a0-5ee1-9a2e-83eb2b44d2ca/scratchpad/fresh.log submission/syn_reports/fresh_clone_rerun.log && cp /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-elec402-p2-open/6503db16-82a0-5ee1-9a2e-83eb2b44d2ca/scratchpad/fresh.sh submission/scripts/fresh_clone_rerun.sh && cat >> notes/WORKLOG.md <<'EOF'\r\n\r\n**Fresh-clone rerun result** (`submission/scripts/fresh_clone_rerun.sh`, log `submission/syn_reports/fresh_clone_rerun.log`).\r\n- *Run:* the clone of 8f205c3 ran from 03:34:16 to 03:36:14, with install.sh and the Docker images already cached.\r\n- *Both RUNs reproduce the committed results exactly:*\r\n  - 400 MHz: +0.152 ns, 2386.552 \u00b5m\u00b2, power 652.53 / 642.80 / 1480.10 / 430.37 \u00b5W;\r\n  - 800 MHz: +0.075 ns, 4755.016 \u00b5m\u00b2, 2727.60 / 3073.10 / 5209.50 / 2535.60 \u00b5W;\r\n  - check, sim and timing all ALL PASS; F14 166/166 and 577/577; timing_fail TIMING FAIL for both; mutants 11/11 and 13/13.\r\n- *`git status` after the run:* only logs changed (synth.log, resize.log and the tool_versions.txt date). Netlists, SDF and reports are byte-identical.\r\nEOF\r\ngit fetch -q origin check-results 2>&1 | tail -1; git ls-remote origin | grep -c check-results\r\nfatal: couldn't find remote ref check-results\r\n0\r\n"]
[3786.861, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m python3 - <<'EOF'\r\np='submission/pdf_report/src/report.md'\r\ns=open(p).read()\r\ns=s.replace(\"All tool versions are recorded in `submission/syn_reports/tool_versions.txt`. The steps are as follows.\",\r\n\"All tool versions are recorded in `submission/syn_reports/tool_versions.txt`. To check that the flow is reproducible, the pushed branch was cloned afresh and the whole flow was rerun for both frequencies (`submission/scripts/fresh_clone_rerun.sh`): install, all five steps, the failing-netlist demonstrations, the F14 check and the mutation tests. It finished in two minutes with the Docker images already cached, and every netlist, SDF file and report came out byte-identical to the committed ones (`syn_reports/fresh_clone_rerun.log`). The steps are as follows.\")\r\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\r\nEOF\r\nbash submission/scripts/build_report.sh 2>&1 | tail -1; cat build/report/tokens.md | tail -3; pdftotext -f 1 -l 1 submission/pdf_report/report.pdf - | head -8\r\nreport written: submission/pdf_report/report.pdf (Pages:           49)\r\n| **claude-opus-5-5, total** | **305** | **593** | **440,903** | **496,976** | **433,050** | **67,599,169** | **28.29** |\r\n\r\nTotal cost at API prices: **USD 28.29** (4 transcripts, 305 API responses).\r\nmkMultBuff: a pipelined signed 16 \u00d7 16 multiplier with a 64-entry\r\nfill/drain buffer at 400 MHz and 800 MHz\r\nDesign report, open-source flow on Nangate45 (FreePDK45), slow corner\r\nClaude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), AI agent in Claude Code\r\n8 November 2026\r\n\r\nContents\r\n1 Results at a glance\r\n"]
