[20433.905, "o", "\u001b[1;32m$\u001b[0m docker run --rm -v $PWD:$PWD -w $PWD -e LIB=tech/NangateOpenCellLibrary_slow.lib -e NETLIST=build/cg/d/map.v -e PERIOD=2.5 --entrypoint /OpenSTA/build/sta openroad/opensta@sha256:4162b4be70ee69eaa42e5eb3c830433393ff46cf0370f9b6c5b814b48a221a7a -no_init -no_splash -exit build/cg/scripts/hold_prop.tcl > build/cg/d/rep/hold_prop.rpt 2>&1; grep -v \"^Warning\" build/cg/d/rep/hold_prop.rpt | awk '/Startpoint/{n++} n==2' | sed -n 1,45p; grep \"flops with hold\" build/cg/d/rep/hold_prop.rpt\r\nStartpoint: RST_N (input port clocked by clk)\r\nEndpoint: _3040_ (rising edge-triggered flip-flop clocked by clk)\r\nPath Group: clk\r\nPath Type: min\r\n\r\n   Delay     Time   Description\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------\r\n   0.000    0.000   clock clk (rise edge)\r\n   0.000    0.000   clock network delay (propagated)\r\n   0.000    0.000 v input external delay\r\n   0.006    0.006 v RST_N (in)\r\n   0.084    0.090 v hold1/Z (CLKBUF_X1)\r\n   0.123    0.213 v _1595_/Z (BUF_X1)\r\n   0.126    0.339 v _2948_/ZN (AND3_X1)\r\n   0.000    0.339 v _3040_/D (DFF_X1)\r\n            0.339   data arrival time\r\n\r\n   0.000    0.000   clock clk (rise edge)\r\n   0.000    0.000   clock source latency\r\n   0.000    0.000 ^ clk (in)\r\n   0.076    0.076 ^ _1593_/ZN (AND2_X1)\r\n   0.114    0.190 ^ clkbuf_0_mclk/Z (CLKBUF_X3)\r\n   0.158    0.348 ^ clkbuf_3_0__f_mclk/Z (CLKBUF_X3)\r\n   0.000    0.348 ^ _3040_/CK (DFF_X1)\r\n   0.000    0.348   clock reconvergence pessimism\r\n   0.030    0.378   library hold time\r\n            0.378   data required time\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------\r\n            0.378   data required time\r\n           -0.339   data arrival time\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------\r\n           -0.039   slack (VIOLATED)\r\n\r\n\r\n== flops with hold violation at D: 1\r\n"]
